													value="<font face='PuristaBold' color='#fce300' size='15'>=== SITUATION ===</font>         " \n "<br/><br/>       " \n "A group of thugs coordinated by a local drug lord is currently making weapons in the region and selling them on the blackmarket. Local intelligence has managed to pin 3 locations for a raid. " \n "<br/><br/>     " \n "High command has tasked Task force NAGA to take point in this raid and will be assisted with HIDF Air force. " \n "<br/><br/>  " \n "<font face='PuristaBold' color='#fce300' size='15'>=== Mission ===</font>   " \n "<br/><br/>   " \n "Raid and secure the camps, Find and destroy any weapon caches. " \n "<br/><br/> " \n "<font face='PuristaBold' color='#fce300' size='15'>=== Extra notes/Optional ===</font>   " \n "<br/><br/> " \n "Follow the basic ROE, Bring those who are willing to comply into custody. ";
